ompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b9355ada6c93198e5ab0c3472aac9d7", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f7f15652/uploads/origins/97a1ef1b-f45e-4bbc-9c31-6c01f00a21c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b9355ada6c93198e5ab0c3472aac9d7, https://si.imgix.net/f7f15652/uploads/origins/97a1ef1b-f45e-4bbc-9c31-6c01f00a21c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=40dc5def57ab39b6befa66b110581a53 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f7f15652/uploads/origins/97a1ef1b-f45e-4bbc-9c31-6c01f00a21c6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1ba1bc2aa334321d80b0b820328e916b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは。\n\n私たちが子供の頃の友達と私を描いてくれませんか？背景はシンプルでいいですし、木は描かなくてもいいです。\n\nもしOKなら、本当にありがとうございます。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1LiAFxUSWstelBh10kl7SBtyKsyOQ7q5G/view?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amaneko_Y/works/16", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/69db3b6c/uploads/origins/ceabdc65-3d17-4594-876f-07708a0a4831?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=117788fc799f74806f6a988571fb4085", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/69db3b6c/uploads/origins/ceabdc65-3d17-4594-876f-07708a0a4831?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=117788fc799f74806f6a988571fb4085, https://si.imgix.net/69db3b6c/uploads/origins/ceabdc65-3d17-4594-876f-07708a0a4831?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39d64b3c20b3b865187741bf19ec86c2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/69db3b6c/uploads/origins/ceabdc65-3d17-4594-876f-07708a0a4831?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=db0b3ac0d76c86b82d639a393317048f 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hi! Could you draw my character and her favorite pet, the Penguin prince?  \nMy character is wearing black armor with a black mask covering her eyes.  https://i.imgur.com/8u8tTds.png\nshe also has long black gloves and black thighboots.  \nhttps://i.imgur.com/QRLrh7Z.png https://i.imgur.com/K8pXwqK.jpg\nMake her chest a bit larger to show off her cleavage through the chest window of her armor.\nas for her hair, you can choose from one of the options from the reference link.\nAs for the pose, she could do a similar pose like this\nhttps://i.imgur.com/2IbSlhQ.jpg\nWith the Penguin prince you can put him wherever you see fit.\nhttps://i.imgur.com/RWB21NS.jpg\nAnd finally, could you draw one art without her mask that shows off her Teal color eyes?  https://i.imgur.com/5JS4zeH.png https://i.imgur.com/2BHui9V.png\nAnd another art with her face mask on?  https://i.imgur.com/WAfgvhg.png https://i.imgur.com/XToJ3n5.png\nThank you very much!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/rfetrsx", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amaneko_Y/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5442ba8a/uploads/origins/e68aca55-bb37-4115-94e8-2ba5011a5734?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eda6c05aabf9b61861899f6a2c03e0ab", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5442ba8a/uploads/origins/e68aca55-bb37-4115-94e8-2ba5011a5734?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=eda6c05aabf9b61861899f6a2c03e0ab, https://si.imgix.net/5442ba8a/uploads/origins/e68aca55-bb37-4115-94e8-2ba5011a5734?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7ff432db7308a28de288767d0eeee528 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5442ba8a/uploads/origins/e68aca55-bb37-4115-94e8-2ba5011a5734?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=47f762c055a561e4dbcff0ceafb517e3 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "今回は、凛ちゃんの妹の水着姿のイラストをお願いします。\n\nキャラクターです。黒木 翼（くろき つばさ\n年齢：14歳\n身長：154cm\nカップサイズA\n\nキャラクター紹介\nhttps://i.imgur.com/ne7tMcI.png\nhttps://i.imgur.com/U9SefzO.png\nhttps://i.imgur.com/HrsDN7r.png\nhttps://i.imgur.com/QFZ2O2M.png\n(真ん中の女の子は、キョウ、リン、ツバサのお姉ちゃんです)\n\n青い瞳に黒い髪。\nかわいい牙があります。\nhttps://i.imgur.com/rLYCPoC.jpg?1\n\n服装参考\nhttps://i.imgur.com/IPVKj86.jpg\nhttps://i.imgur.com/U9SefzO.png\n\nこの服を着た彼女を描いてください。\n帽子は描かなくていいです。\n青い髪を結んでいるところを描いてください。\n\nつばさはとても元気で明るい女の子です。\nお世辞を言われると、自分のことで精一杯になる。\n\nポーズや構図はお任せします。\nありがとうございました。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amaneko_Y/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/5f8237be/uploads/origins/97ae9d09-a1e6-41a4-9808-5edecb50d2ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=33864b9f8d2fdde18ed02df63f6dcf1d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5f8237be/uploads/origins/97ae9d09-a1e6-41a4-9808-5edecb50d2ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=33864b9f8d2fdde18ed02df63f6dcf1d, https://si.imgix.net/5f8237be/uploads/origins/97ae9d09-a1e6-41a4-9808-5edecb50d2ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=004d0a789887aba0bf4303cc923786af 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5f8237be/uploads/origins/97ae9d09-a1e6-41a4-9808-5edecb50d2ff?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=876ec97c324d056a8ca96495f7f17162 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして、Vtuberの秋篠ゆずきと申します。\n私自身を描いていただきたくリクエストをお送りします。\n\n下記のバニー服でお願いしたいです。\nhttps://twitter.com/yuzuki_vtuber/status/1510603201342734339/photo/1\n（燕尾服の有無はどちらでもOKです）\n\n・イラストはVTuber活動に使用させていただきたいです。 　\n（アイコン、ヘッダ、サムネイル、動画など）\n・宛名・背景は別レイヤーでお願いできると幸いです。\n\nお忙しいところおそれいりますが、何卒宜しくお願い致します。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@amaneko_Y/works/13", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ce2ba81a/uploads/origins/be1934ec-4586-41b5-b282-c192f95360d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=42a0f99458791dc4bbcd831c7facbefe", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ce2ba81a/uploads/origins/be1934ec-4586-41b5-b282-c192f95360d3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=42a0f99458791dc4bbcd831c7facbefe, https://si.im